      "content": "omg help my baby is so hot and he's just lethargic and crying... he's 11kg and has a crazy fever. i gave him the usual 3ml of the 160mg/5ml stuff but he's not getting better at all. i'm so scared... i saw someone say if it's not working you can give a bigger dose like 15ml to break the fever fast?? is 15ml safe for him?? please i'm panicking he needs help fast 😭",
